{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28524","headline":"和裴杰秀才新樱桃 · 杜牧","name":"和裴杰秀才新樱桃","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"新果真琼液，人应宴紫兰。\n圆疑窃龙颔，色已夺鸡冠。\n远火微微辨，繁星历历看。\n茂先知味好，曼倩恨偷难。\n忍用烹酥酪，从将翫玉盘。\n流年如可驻，何必九华丹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28524.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28524","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}